        </localActions>
        <localActions>
            <fullName>get_funding_context_179We000000q0jv</fullName>
            <description>Traces the funding lineage/relationships around a starting point and returns a decision-ready summary. Two directions: (1) a Budget Line scope (country + business unit, optionally fiscal year and the cost dimensions) returns what funds it — the linked allocations, restrictions, gift commitments, opportunities and donors, with headroom and competing insight; (2) a named grant (opportunityName) returns where that grant&apos;s funding is allocated — the Budget Lines it funds, using allocation amounts, not the whole opportunity amount. Reports missing links (e.g. no gift commitment) instead of guessing.</description>
            <developerName>get_funding_context_179We000000q0jv</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>AmaizeGetFundingContext</invocationTarget>
